# Allow-list: the build context contains ONLY the files the image needs.
# Everything else is excluded by default, including:
#   data/ and any *.db / *.db-wal / *.db-shm (real financial records), backups/, restore/
#   .env and any credentials or keys, .git/, node_modules/, .npm-cache/, __pycache__/, .venv/,
#   test-results/, tests/, .vscode/, documentation and PDF-derived text.
*

!server.py
!accounts.py
!workspace_features.py
!business_expenses.py
!backup_db.py
!static/
!static/**

# Defence in depth: never include databases or caches even if they appear under an allowed path.
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
